## Scope

Lessons-side repairs for sentinel `mbm-full-repair-upgrade-2026-08-07`, based on measured starting tip `aad7b5017bbf517915304e2280894e9874647822`.

## Repair implemented

`chemistry/Lesson2_pH_Scale_v4.html`

- fixed the documented boot exception caused by calling `.trim()` on an undefined `innerText` value;
- added a single safe text accessor that falls back to `textContent` and an empty string;
- reused the same accessor when collecting printable teacher notes;
- preserved lesson content, sequence, controls and visual identity.

## Executed validation

A one-shot branch workflow applied and tested the repair, then was removed from the final diff. It proved:

- the original/weakened placeholder implementation fails under jsdom with the recorded undefined `.trim()` defect;
- every inline script passes `node --check`;
- the repaired real lesson boots with zero meaningful jsdom errors;
- all three `[data-placeholder]` surfaces initialise to their own placeholder text;
- the final net diff contains only the repaired lesson file.

This PR remains draft while the paired site workflow performs the wider repository and cross-repository regression pass. Additional Lessons repairs discovered by that measured pass will be appended here rather than opened as competing PRs.

