Temporary closeout-audit branch for sentinel `mbm-post-upgrade-final-estate-closeout-2026-08-08`.

This PR adds no production UI or provider implementation. Its workflow:

- re-runs the permanent Professional, Accounts/Mailing and Games/audience gates;
- checks out the current Lessons, Games and Apps repositories;
- derives the same-day Git/file inventory;
- audits repository health, malformed/truncated files, conflicts, secrets, local-development links and temporary workflow residue;
- waits for and byte-compares the exact PR #102 merged homepage, account runtime and `site.json` on `madebymatt.uk`;
- crawls production routes, manifests, sitemaps, fragments and local assets;
- renders Home, Games, Lessons, Apps, Tools, Resources, Account, Members, Mailing and Privacy at 320, 360, 390, 430, 768, 1024, 1280 and 1440 CSS px;
- checks runtime errors, same-origin failures, overflow, mobile drawer release, focus, touch floor, account/mailing/privacy truth and signed-out public access;
- uploads machine-readable JSON and a Markdown summary.

The workflow is disposable and will be removed after its evidence is read. Any permanent defect found will be repaired at its source before this branch is closed.

## Scope

